hooked on pain medication.

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:30.680
And from there it turned
into heroin and heroin

00:02:30.680 --> 00:02:31.551
turned into fentanyl.

00:02:31.551 --> 00:02:33.034
- [Mark] So in fentanyl is your drug now?

00:02:33.034 --> 00:02:33.867
- Yeah.

00:02:33.867 --> 00:02:35.080
- [Mark] And you're smoking it or?

00:02:35.080 --> 00:02:39.650
- I inject and smoke, yeah. Unfortunately.

00:02:39.650 --> 00:02:40.580
- [Mark] It's a dangerous drug.

00:02:40.580 --> 00:02:43.611
- Yeah, it is. I've known a
lot of people die here, yeah.

00:02:43.611 --> 00:02:44.970
Quite a few.

00:02:44.970 --> 00:02:47.060
- [Mark] And how are you
supporting yourself now?

00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:48.450
- Right now, mainly boosting

00:02:48.450 --> 00:02:52.360
and small drug deals here and there, yeah.

00:02:52.360 --> 00:02:54.830
- [Mark] You get caught
for it for boosting yet?

00:02:54.830 --> 00:02:56.940
- You know, I got caught one time and due

00:02:56.940 --> 00:02:59.410
to the COVID right now it's
really hard to go to jail.

00:02:59.410 --> 00:03:02.281
Thank God. And so they just
tell you to not come back.

00:03:02.281 --> 00:03:03.470
- [Mark] Yeah.

00:03:03.470 --> 00:03:04.303
- Yeah.

00:03:04.303 --> 00:03:05.136
- [Mark] They don't want to hold you.

00:03:05.136 --> 00:03:05.969
- Yeah. It's very hard
to go to jail right now.

00:03:05.969 --> 00:03:08.509
You have to be gifted
to go to jail right now.

00:03:08.509 --> 00:03:10.810
And not to mention to,
San Francisco County alone

00:03:10.810 --> 00:03:12.357
it's kind of like a safe haven here,

00:03:12.357 --> 00:03:14.600
where as opposed to,
you go to the East Bay,

00:03:14.600 --> 00:03:15.610
you go to Alameda or you go

00:03:15.610 --> 00:03:19.003
