drugs, anything like

00:03:23.620 --> 00:03:27.310
that here, they tend to look
a blind eye towards, so yeah.

00:03:27.310 --> 00:03:29.260
- [Mark] And how old are you?
- I am 34.

00:03:29.260 --> 00:03:31.010
