relationship went to hell.

00:03:49.590 --> 00:03:52.010
That really, that was downer
on me, so that's kinda-

00:03:52.010 --> 00:03:52.950
- [Mark] That's what got you relapsed?

00:03:52.950 --> 00:03:54.525
- Yeah. That's what got me relapsed

00:03:54.525 --> 00:03:55.970
